---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import SectionHeader from '../components/SectionHeader.astro';
---
<Layout active="mining" title="Mining — NÉGOCE ET COMMERCE DE RIM" description="Mining resources, minerals and metals commercial opportunities connected to Mauritania.">
  <section class="section"><div class="container"><div style="max-width:850px"><div class="kicker" data-en="Mining & resources" data-es="Minería y recursos" data-fr="Mines et ressources">Mining & resources</div><h1 class="h1" data-en="Structured conversations around minerals, metals and resources." data-es="Conversaciones estructuradas sobre minerales, metales y recursos." data-fr="Échanges structurés autour des minerais, métaux et ressources.">Structured conversations around minerals, metals and resources.</h1><p class="lead" data-en="We explore resource-related opportunities with commercial and technical partners while prioritising clear documentation, compliance and responsible long-term cooperation." data-es="Exploramos oportunidades relacionadas con recursos junto a socios comerciales y técnicos, priorizando documentación clara, cumplimiento y cooperación responsable a largo plazo." data-fr="Nous explorons les opportunités liées aux ressources avec des partenaires commerciaux et techniques, en privilégiant documentation claire, conformité et coopération responsable.">We explore resource-related opportunities with commercial and technical partners while prioritising clear documentation, compliance and responsible long-term cooperation.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="section-sm"><div class="container grid three"><div class="card"><div class="icon-box"><Icon name="pickaxe" /></div><h3 data-en="Minerals and metals" data-es="Minerales y metales" data-fr="Minerais et métaux">Minerals and metals</h3><p class="muted" data-en="Initial commercial orientation for opportunities connected to mineral resources and metals." data-es="Orientación comercial inicial para oportunidades vinculadas a recursos minerales y metales." data-fr="Orientation commerciale initiale pour opportunités liées aux ressources minérales et métaux.">Initial commercial orientation for opportunities connected to mineral resources and metals.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="icon-box"><Icon name="document" /></div><h3 data-en="Due diligence" data-es="Due diligence" data-fr="Due diligence">Due diligence</h3><p class="muted" data-en="We favour traceable information, clear agreements and responsible conversations before any next step." data-es="Priorizamos información trazable, acuerdos claros y conversaciones responsables antes de cualquier siguiente paso." data-fr="Nous privilégions informations traçables, accords clairs et discussions responsables avant toute étape.">We favour traceable information, clear agreements and responsible conversations before any next step.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="icon-box"><Icon name="handshake" /></div><h3 data-en="Technical partners" data-es="Socios técnicos" data-fr="Partenaires techniques">Technical partners</h3><p class="muted" data-en="Cooperation with serious actors who understand the technical, legal and commercial side of resource projects." data-es="Cooperación con actores serios que entienden el lado técnico, legal y comercial de los proyectos de recursos." data-fr="Coopération avec acteurs sérieux comprenant les aspects techniques, juridiques et commerciaux.">Cooperation with serious actors who understand the technical, legal and commercial side of resource projects.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="section-sm"><div class="container"><SectionHeader kicker="Responsible approach" kickerEs="Enfoque responsable" kickerFr="Approche responsable" title="We do not rush resource opportunities." titleEs="No aceleramos oportunidades de recursos sin base." titleFr="Nous ne précipitons pas les opportunités liées aux ressources." lead="Resource-related trade requires careful validation, serious partners and a clear understanding of the commercial route." leadEs="El comercio relacionado con recursos requiere validación cuidadosa, socios serios y una comprensión clara de la ruta comercial." leadFr="Le commerce lié aux ressources exige validation prudente, partenaires sérieux et compréhension claire de la route commerciale." /></div></section>
  <section class="section-sm"><div class="container grid two"><div class="surface" style="border-radius:34px;padding:34px"><h3 data-en="For buyers" data-es="Para compradores" data-fr="Pour acheteurs">For buyers</h3><p class="muted" data-en="We can help open early commercial discussions where there is a clear product interest, defined requirements and serious intent." data-es="Podemos ayudar a abrir conversaciones comerciales iniciales cuando hay interés claro, requisitos definidos e intención seria." data-fr="Nous pouvons ouvrir des discussions initiales lorsqu’il y a intérêt clair, exigences définies et intention sérieuse.">We can help open early commercial discussions where there is a clear product interest, defined requirements and serious intent.</p></div><div class="surface" style="border-radius:34px;padding:34px"><h3 data-en="For partners" data-es="Para socios" data-fr="Pour partenaires">For partners</h3><p class="muted" data-en="We look for reliable technical and commercial partners able to work with discipline, documentation and long-term thinking." data-es="Buscamos socios técnicos y comerciales fiables capaces de trabajar con disciplina, documentación y visión a largo plazo." data-fr="Nous recherchons des partenaires techniques et commerciaux fiables, disciplinés, documentés et orientés long terme.">We look for reliable technical and commercial partners able to work with discipline, documentation and long-term thinking.</p></div></div></section>
</Layout>
